      "chunk_id": "a82e38a6-d46e-426d-adee-dad1ec7ef79a",
      "content": "AI Tool Usage\n\nEmployees may use approved AI tools for drafting, summarization, and analysis when the data classification allows it. Confidential or restricted data must not be pasted into unapproved AI tools.\n\nGenerated AI output must be reviewed before being sent to customers, used for policy interpretation, or relied on for security decisions.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002003",
      "document_id": "IT-001",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
