        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "0d9d7c45-66f4-4fba-8b47-f9e8922840c6",
      "content": "Local Storage\n\nCustomer data, restricted data, and regulated data should not be stored locally unless there is a documented business need and approved protection. Files should be stored in company-approved cloud storage with access controls.",
